1
00:01:36,160 --> 00:01:40,020
[River of No Return]

2
00:01:40,140 --> 00:01:42,990
[Episode 7: Bandit Gang]

3
00:01:47,289 --> 00:01:47,900
Attack!

4
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,560
I don't feed you for nothing!

5
00:01:49,729 --> 00:01:51,450
-Kill this bastard!
-Granny Tong!

6
00:01:51,450 --> 00:01:53,160
-I'll take the blame if he dies.
-Granny Tong!

7
00:01:53,160 --> 00:01:54,490
If you want to die today,

8
00:01:54,590 --> 00:01:55,870
I'll grant your wish.

9
00:01:55,950 --> 00:01:57,180
Attack! Kill him!

10
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,280
-Go away!
-Go!

11
00:01:59,450 --> 00:02:00,450
-Move!
-Go!

12
00:02:01,210 --> 00:02:01,960
Kill him!

13
00:02:02,390 --> 00:02:02,920
Get lost!

14
00:02:03,040 --> 00:02:04,100
Remember clearly—

15
00:02:04,230 --> 00:02:05,160
3 men and 1 woman.

16
00:02:05,290 --> 00:02:08,289
Especially keep an eye
on the one with the arrow wound.

17
00:02:14,350 --> 00:02:15,480
Good-for-Nothing.

18
00:02:16,290 --> 00:02:16,910
Good-for-Nothing!

19
00:02:16,910 --> 00:02:17,350
Go!

20
00:02:17,370 --> 00:02:18,300
Why are you here?

21
00:02:18,850 --> 00:02:19,350
Hurry!

22
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:08,620
Search the backyard!

23
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:20,800
Don't move!

24
00:03:21,040 --> 00:03:21,700
Don't move.

25
00:03:29,880 --> 00:03:30,540
Don't move.

26
00:03:31,079 --> 00:03:31,790
Don't move!

27
00:03:32,630 --> 00:03:33,260
Step back!

28
00:03:34,579 --> 00:03:35,380
Go back first.

29
00:03:37,510 --> 00:03:38,540
You pighead.

30
00:03:39,810 --> 00:03:40,700
Step back!

31
00:03:41,700 --> 00:03:42,540
Step back!

32
00:03:44,790 --> 00:03:45,420
Step back!

33
00:03:47,290 --> 00:03:49,480
As an imperial official,

34
00:03:49,660 --> 00:03:50,920
coming to such a filthy place

35
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,190
in broad daylight

36
00:03:52,350 --> 00:03:53,140
is so disgraceful!

37
00:03:53,140 --> 00:03:53,800
Step aside!

38
00:03:54,610 --> 00:03:55,770
I'll kick you!

39
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:57,390
What's your problem?

40
00:04:00,150 --> 00:04:02,810
♪ I brave the wind, I hit the ground ♪

41
00:04:02,850 --> 00:04:04,730
♪ I take the blows head-on,
never crying out in pain ♪

42
00:04:05,610 --> 00:04:08,390
♪ My life hangs by a thread,
my worries buried in my bones ♪

43
00:04:08,610 --> 00:04:11,330
♪ Whatever I owe, I'll repay in time ♪

44
00:04:09,290 --> 00:04:10,350
Good-for-Nothing!

45
00:04:10,350 --> 00:04:10,980
Catch it!

46
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:12,860
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

47
00:04:12,890 --> 00:04:14,180
♪ Swaying along, swaying along ♪

48
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,710
♪ Swaying along—
what's all the swaying for? ♪

49
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:18,200
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

50
00:04:18,200 --> 00:04:18,750
Hurry up!

51
00:04:18,329 --> 00:04:19,570
♪ Chasing them down, chasing them down ♪

52
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:19,510
Hurry!

53
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,820
♪ Chasing them down—
what am I chasing for? ♪

54
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:20,339
Okay.

55
00:04:22,410 --> 00:04:24,010
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

56
00:04:22,990 --> 00:04:23,670
Hurry up!

57
00:04:24,030 --> 00:04:25,440
♪ Who knows? Who cares about me? ♪

58
00:04:25,550 --> 00:04:27,240
♪ Who knows where home is? ♪

59
00:04:28,580 --> 00:04:30,020
♪ To hell with princes and nobles ♪

60
00:04:30,060 --> 00:04:31,450
♪ To hell with
what the history books say ♪

61
00:04:30,170 --> 00:04:31,070
Here, take it!

62
00:04:31,470 --> 00:04:33,690
♪ I'm my own guardian angel ♪

63
00:04:35,430 --> 00:04:35,870
Hurry!

64
00:04:36,050 --> 00:04:36,510
Go!

65
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:38,070
Okay.

66
00:04:54,100 --> 00:04:54,750
You said

67
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:57,280
asking the Crown Prince
to go to Jinling to supervise the state

68
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,490
will share the Emperor's worries
and reassure the people.

69
00:04:59,490 --> 00:05:00,460
The Six Ministries of Jinling

70
00:05:00,460 --> 00:05:02,460
are busy with
canal transport and military supplies,

71
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:03,900
and need His Highness to take charge.

72
00:05:03,900 --> 00:05:05,920
Why is His Highness unhappy about this?

73
00:05:05,920 --> 00:05:07,720
Who started this talk?

74
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:10,640
Your Highness,

75
00:05:10,950 --> 00:05:12,670
I am only being loyal.

76
00:05:12,670 --> 00:05:13,430
Loyal?

77
00:05:14,220 --> 00:05:15,930
I think you are greedy for pleasure,

78
00:05:15,930 --> 00:05:17,660
driven by your desire for ease.

79
00:05:17,950 --> 00:05:20,150
You're sick of staying in Beijing, huh?

80
00:05:20,460 --> 00:05:23,140
I wouldn't dare!

81
00:05:23,340 --> 00:05:24,200
Wouldn't dare?

82
00:05:24,870 --> 00:05:26,070
I'd like to ask:

83
00:05:28,380 --> 00:05:30,460
do you know
what reassuring the people means?

84
00:05:30,460 --> 00:05:33,190
Do the common people know
what supervising the state means?

85
00:05:33,190 --> 00:05:34,140
They only know

86
00:05:34,580 --> 00:05:36,510
the new Emperor
has just ascended the throne.

87
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:37,190
Yet, now

88
00:05:37,380 --> 00:05:39,750
the Crown Prince
is being sent out of the capital.

89
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:41,480
Is this reassuring the people,

90
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:44,159
or giving the world
a chance to spread rumors?

91
00:05:45,310 --> 00:05:45,870
Go!

92
00:05:46,310 --> 00:05:48,310
If you truly care about the country,

93
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:51,070
you should hope
for my Father's good health,

94
00:05:51,070 --> 00:05:53,340
instead of rushing
to arrange a place for me.

95
00:05:53,340 --> 00:05:55,070
As long as my Father is still around,

96
00:05:55,070 --> 00:05:56,320
no one else gets to make decisions

97
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,990
for this world on his behalf.

98
00:06:11,140 --> 00:06:11,990
Rectifier Yu.

99
00:06:17,630 --> 00:06:18,460
Rectifier Yu.

100
00:06:20,270 --> 00:06:21,330
Can you tell me

101
00:06:22,390 --> 00:06:24,520
what the Iron Alliance actually does?

102
00:06:36,370 --> 00:06:37,510
Over 20 years ago,

103
00:06:38,020 --> 00:06:39,380
Emperor Jianwen reduced the power
of the vassal lords.

104
00:06:39,380 --> 00:06:40,380
Emperor Taizong,

105
00:06:41,510 --> 00:06:43,230
the Crown Prince's grandfather,

106
00:06:43,230 --> 00:06:45,200
was still the Prince of Yan at that time.

107
00:06:45,200 --> 00:06:48,530
He raised an army in the name
of clearing the emperor's side.

108
00:06:48,990 --> 00:06:50,450
When they attacked Jinan,

109
00:06:51,460 --> 00:06:53,590
Tie Xuan fought to the death to resist.

110
00:06:56,550 --> 00:06:57,220
And then?

111
00:06:57,810 --> 00:06:58,580
Later,

112
00:07:00,430 --> 00:07:02,090
the Prince of Yan had no choice

113
00:07:02,280 --> 00:07:04,540
but to bypass Jinan and capture Jinling.

114
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:06,870
After ascending the throne,

115
00:07:06,870 --> 00:07:10,630
Emperor Taizong returned
with his army to capture Tie Xuan.

116
00:07:11,010 --> 00:07:12,740
Tie Xuan refused to surrender.

117
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:16,190
It was his subordinates who mutinied

118
00:07:16,550 --> 00:07:18,350
and sent Tie Xuan to the capital.

119
00:07:18,820 --> 00:07:20,750
Tie Xuan still fought to the death—

120
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,610
rather die than surrender.

121
00:07:23,140 --> 00:07:25,340
He was later killed by Emperor Taizong.

122
00:07:25,460 --> 00:07:27,020
His parents were exiled to Hainan.

123
00:07:27,020 --> 00:07:28,950
His wife, daughters, and maids

124
00:07:31,670 --> 00:07:34,070
were all sent to
the Imperial Music Office.

125
00:07:37,510 --> 00:07:39,310
Shortly after Tie Xuan's death,

126
00:07:39,450 --> 00:07:40,840
his former subordinates

127
00:07:40,840 --> 00:07:42,240
formed an organization,

128
00:07:42,450 --> 00:07:44,820
swearing to be enemies
of the imperial court

129
00:07:44,820 --> 00:07:45,900
to avenge Tie Xuan.

130
00:07:47,020 --> 00:07:48,070
Over time,

131
00:07:48,580 --> 00:07:50,140
the people gave it the name

132
00:07:50,950 --> 00:07:52,010
the Iron Alliance.

133
00:07:58,690 --> 00:07:59,490
Your Majesty.

134
00:07:59,950 --> 00:08:01,690
The rebel Tie Xuan and his subordinates

135
00:08:01,690 --> 00:08:02,950
are all detained here.

136
00:08:13,430 --> 00:08:14,380
Rectifier Yu.

137
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:16,640
Yes, Your Highness.

138
00:08:17,380 --> 00:08:18,510
You are an official.

139
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,310
Tie Xuan's story—

140
00:08:21,380 --> 00:08:24,380
while ordinary people
might talk about it in private,

141
00:08:25,110 --> 00:08:26,640
you absolutely cannot.

142
00:08:28,950 --> 00:08:29,960
Neighboring women curse each other,

143
00:08:29,960 --> 00:08:31,420
each for their own master.

144
00:08:31,510 --> 00:08:33,909
Tie Xuan was a rebel to Emperor Taizong,

145
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,700
but to Emperor Jianwen,

146
00:08:36,590 --> 00:08:37,850
he was a loyal subject.

147
00:08:38,539 --> 00:08:40,330
To us civil officials,

148
00:08:40,909 --> 00:08:42,570
Prime Minister Wen Tianxiang

149
00:08:42,789 --> 00:08:44,270
is a predecessor and sage,

150
00:08:45,240 --> 00:08:47,580
and Tie Xuan is a modern role model.

151
00:08:48,390 --> 00:08:50,450
What's wrong with talking about him?

152
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:56,140
You really aren't afraid
of getting into trouble.

153
00:09:00,860 --> 00:09:02,190
After Tie Xuan's death,

154
00:09:02,550 --> 00:09:04,530
the people of Jinan,
on the anniversary of his death,

155
00:09:04,530 --> 00:09:05,860
would go to Daming Lake.

156
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:09,860
They would stick
half a willow branch into the ground

157
00:09:09,860 --> 00:09:10,950
as incense

158
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:13,220
and kowtow to pay their respects.

159
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:28,220
Then isn't Aunt Hong

160
00:09:28,950 --> 00:09:30,270
Tie Xuan's relative?

161
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:39,320
A prostitute is putting up an act
of being loyal to me, huh?

162
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,180
My Lord!

163
00:09:40,220 --> 00:09:41,670
No, you can't kill her!

164
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:42,740
She can't die.

165
00:09:42,950 --> 00:09:43,820
If she dies,

166
00:09:44,170 --> 00:09:46,070
it will be hard to explain
to the Imperial Music Office.

167
00:09:46,070 --> 00:09:47,320
These guilty officials' families—

168
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:49,080
the prefectural office
will ask about them.

169
00:09:49,080 --> 00:09:49,980
When she dies,

170
00:09:50,770 --> 00:09:53,240
you can have
the prefectural office coming after me.

171
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,310
Say something!

172
00:09:55,770 --> 00:09:57,550
If you don't want to die, tell me quickly.

173
00:09:57,550 --> 00:09:58,950
Where did Wu Dingyuan go?

174
00:10:02,290 --> 00:10:05,290
He said he wanted
to leave the city as soon as possible.

175
00:10:06,030 --> 00:10:08,430
He should be heading towards Xishui Pass.

176
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:11,500
Are you kidding me?

177
00:10:11,790 --> 00:10:13,590
Xishui Pass is heavily guarded.

178
00:10:14,030 --> 00:10:15,960
Are they walking right into a trap?

179
00:10:16,770 --> 00:10:17,430
My Lord.

180
00:10:19,340 --> 00:10:19,910
My Lord.

181
00:10:20,860 --> 00:10:21,340
Speak.

182
00:10:21,450 --> 00:10:22,700
Near Xishui Pass,

183
00:10:22,950 --> 00:10:25,480
we found an awning boat
drifting downstream.

184
00:10:27,650 --> 00:10:28,910
You forced me to speak,

185
00:10:29,030 --> 00:10:29,910
and I did.

186
00:10:30,360 --> 00:10:31,820
Yet you didn't believe me.

187
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:07,310
Envoy.

188
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,250
We were really fooled by Wu Buping.

189
00:11:11,290 --> 00:11:12,080
Iron Lion said

190
00:11:12,080 --> 00:11:13,410
the person we are looking for is dead.

191
00:11:13,410 --> 00:11:15,030
Let's find Uncle Liang first.

192
00:11:15,030 --> 00:11:17,000
He won't listen to everything I say.

193
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:17,740
With his temper,

194
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:18,980
if he sees Wu Dingyuan,

195
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:20,500
who knows what he might do.

196
00:11:21,460 --> 00:11:22,860
What about his daughter?

197
00:11:23,220 --> 00:11:24,670
Contact the leader first.

198
00:11:24,670 --> 00:11:26,400
Isn't Wu Dingyuan still alive?

199
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,620
Then his sister must still be useful.

200
00:11:53,220 --> 00:11:54,620
This is Xishui Pass.

201
00:11:59,030 --> 00:11:59,890
Your Highness.

202
00:12:00,910 --> 00:12:03,070
We can directly enter
the outer Qinhuai River

203
00:12:03,070 --> 00:12:04,150
and head west.

204
00:12:04,670 --> 00:12:05,670
Pass Stone City,

205
00:12:06,340 --> 00:12:08,140
go through Qingliang Mountain.

206
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:10,420
As long as we reach...

207
00:12:10,790 --> 00:12:12,050
reach Longjiang Pass,

208
00:12:12,620 --> 00:12:14,350
we can enter the Yangtze River.

209
00:12:16,150 --> 00:12:17,030
By then,

210
00:12:17,740 --> 00:12:19,070
we will be free as birds.

211
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:21,740
Zhu Buhua can only

212
00:12:22,270 --> 00:12:23,340
sigh in despair!

213
00:12:24,190 --> 00:12:26,030
Are there no guards

214
00:12:26,340 --> 00:12:28,270
at Xishui Pass and Longjiang Pass?

215
00:12:32,080 --> 00:12:35,270
Your Highness, that good-for-nothing
must've chosen this path

216
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,390
for a reason.

217
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,270
Come.

218
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,730
You're starting to rely on him now?

219
00:12:42,450 --> 00:12:43,170
Thanks.

220
00:12:45,090 --> 00:12:46,730
I'm just following
the story of Lord Mengchang.

221
00:12:46,730 --> 00:12:49,190
Even the lowest-level skills
can be useful.

222
00:12:52,290 --> 00:12:53,550
You're overthinking.

223
00:12:53,580 --> 00:12:55,840
We haven't even reached Xishui Pass yet.

224
00:12:55,860 --> 00:12:57,860
Then why are we getting off the boat?

225
00:12:58,070 --> 00:12:59,460
Zhu Buhua isn't stupid.

226
00:12:59,810 --> 00:13:00,880
Of course he'd guess

227
00:13:00,880 --> 00:13:02,680
that we would take the waterway.

228
00:13:03,120 --> 00:13:05,250
Xishui Pass is adjacent to Longjiang.

229
00:13:05,290 --> 00:13:07,550
It will be heavily guarded immediately.

230
00:13:08,030 --> 00:13:09,620
I don't want to walk into a death trap.

231
00:13:09,620 --> 00:13:10,550
But we are still

232
00:13:11,310 --> 00:13:12,840
within the prefectural office's
jurisdiction.

233
00:13:12,840 --> 00:13:14,770
-We can't escape from them.
-Okay.

234
00:13:14,770 --> 00:13:15,860
I promised you

235
00:13:16,310 --> 00:13:17,950
I would get you out safely.

236
00:13:18,110 --> 00:13:19,400
Let's go. Hurry up.

237
00:13:20,150 --> 00:13:22,030
He's right. Listen to him.

238
00:13:26,670 --> 00:13:28,790
It's fine. Take care of yourself.

239
00:13:30,590 --> 00:13:31,380
Yes.

240
00:13:35,410 --> 00:13:39,040
[Shangyuan Gate]

241
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:42,690
Good-for-Nothing.

242
00:13:42,690 --> 00:13:43,500
Where is this?

243
00:13:44,030 --> 00:13:45,430
Why did you bring us here?

244
00:13:45,890 --> 00:13:46,500
It's so high up.

245
00:13:46,500 --> 00:13:48,360
How are we going to get down later?

246
00:13:48,480 --> 00:13:51,210
Shangyuan Gate is
the northernmost pass of Jinling.

247
00:13:51,210 --> 00:13:53,540
Zhu Buhua would never think of this place.

248
00:13:53,820 --> 00:13:56,070
This is the territory
of the White Dragon Gang.

249
00:13:56,070 --> 00:13:57,130
White Dragon Gang?

250
00:13:57,390 --> 00:13:58,530
What are you trying to do?

251
00:13:58,530 --> 00:13:59,270
What is that?

252
00:14:00,320 --> 00:14:02,600
The White Dragon Gang
are famous bandits in Jinling.

253
00:14:02,600 --> 00:14:03,980
Using white cloth as ropes,

254
00:14:03,980 --> 00:14:05,980
they specialize in stealing
from Jinling's granaries.

255
00:14:05,980 --> 00:14:07,550
Right under the nose
of the secondary capital,

256
00:14:07,550 --> 00:14:09,750
how could these thieves be so arrogant?

257
00:14:13,390 --> 00:14:14,320
Little Xingren.

258
00:14:15,220 --> 00:14:15,820
Come here.

259
00:14:16,670 --> 00:14:17,190
What?

260
00:14:17,740 --> 00:14:18,620
Go set up

261
00:14:19,030 --> 00:14:19,620
that qin.

262
00:14:19,740 --> 00:14:20,220
Go.

263
00:14:21,550 --> 00:14:22,190
Why?

264
00:14:23,030 --> 00:14:23,740
Why?

265
00:14:24,190 --> 00:14:25,790
Do you want to leave the city?

266
00:14:26,670 --> 00:14:27,190
Yes.

267
00:14:27,670 --> 00:14:30,000
If you want to leave the city,
set up the qin

268
00:14:30,270 --> 00:14:32,340
and have your Crown Prince play it.

269
00:14:32,570 --> 00:14:33,100
Go.

270
00:14:45,450 --> 00:14:46,190
Old Mule.

271
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:47,860
Old Mule!

272
00:14:49,080 --> 00:14:50,390
Shut your mouth.

273
00:14:51,190 --> 00:14:52,650
Then I shall stop talking.

274
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,540
Let's not leave the city either.

275
00:14:56,320 --> 00:14:57,070
Go.

276
00:14:57,920 --> 00:14:58,870
Make some noise.

277
00:14:59,200 --> 00:14:59,950
Make what?

278
00:15:00,950 --> 00:15:01,790
Play the qin.

279
00:15:06,910 --> 00:15:07,820
Play the qin?

280
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:10,070
Here?

281
00:15:11,690 --> 00:15:12,490
What's wrong?

282
00:15:12,840 --> 00:15:14,700
Shall I build a pavilion for you

283
00:15:14,860 --> 00:15:16,190
to play the qin in peace?

284
00:15:21,120 --> 00:15:22,180
What should I play?

285
00:15:22,240 --> 00:15:23,320
What should you play?

286
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:24,700
Play whatever you want.

287
00:15:24,820 --> 00:15:25,620
It's up to you.

288
00:15:26,190 --> 00:15:27,720
As long as it's loud enough.

289
00:15:28,170 --> 00:15:28,790
Play.

290
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,670
Nobody move.

291
00:16:38,950 --> 00:16:41,410
The chief of White Dragon Gang,
Dragon Head,

292
00:16:41,570 --> 00:16:42,370
has instincts

293
00:16:43,310 --> 00:16:44,640
finer than a qin string—

294
00:16:44,890 --> 00:16:46,220
it will break at a touch.

295
00:17:07,540 --> 00:17:08,630
Where is your qin?

296
00:17:21,720 --> 00:17:22,980
Liang Xingfu?

297
00:17:24,480 --> 00:17:25,480
Where is your qin?

298
00:17:26,200 --> 00:17:27,730
The qin strings are broken.

299
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:29,990
I sent it out to be repaired.

300
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:31,190
Iron Lion,

301
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,460
you are now a qin with broken strings.

302
00:17:34,220 --> 00:17:35,480
I pity you,

303
00:17:35,910 --> 00:17:37,240
all alone and helpless.

304
00:17:45,590 --> 00:17:47,060
You're from the Iron Alliance?

305
00:17:47,060 --> 00:17:49,860
What exactly is your relationship
with Wu Buping?

306
00:17:49,890 --> 00:17:51,090
This is Fule Brothel.

307
00:17:52,190 --> 00:17:54,390
What other relationship could we have?

308
00:17:56,960 --> 00:17:59,620
You two are top-class
at making up stories.

309
00:18:02,170 --> 00:18:04,020
We know all about Zhong Eryong.

310
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:06,450
You don't need to cover for him.

311
00:18:07,200 --> 00:18:08,910
Wu Yulu is also in our hands.

312
00:18:10,680 --> 00:18:12,280
We are supposed to be family.

313
00:18:13,500 --> 00:18:14,900
What exactly do you want?

314
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:17,830
A qin player without a qin—

315
00:18:18,450 --> 00:18:20,850
don't you think Fule Brothel's
Granny Tong

316
00:18:20,890 --> 00:18:22,350
will be suspicious of you?

317
00:18:44,860 --> 00:18:48,130
[Dragon Head, White Dragon Gang]

318
00:18:45,590 --> 00:18:48,190
Miss Hong Yu's Xiyueqin

319
00:18:48,430 --> 00:18:50,590
is a top-grade qin.

320
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:53,540
The piece "Crows Crying at Night" just now

321
00:18:54,020 --> 00:18:55,950
captured the essence of its charm.

322
00:18:56,150 --> 00:18:57,300
In the wilderness,

323
00:18:57,830 --> 00:19:00,190
listening to it at sunset

324
00:19:01,780 --> 00:19:03,740
has a unique charm.

325
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:07,170
Dragon Head, I only have one request:

326
00:19:07,220 --> 00:19:08,020
we

327
00:19:08,430 --> 00:19:10,430
want to borrow your path
to leave the city.

328
00:19:10,430 --> 00:19:11,980
You talk big.

329
00:19:12,870 --> 00:19:13,700
Why should I?

330
00:19:16,190 --> 00:19:17,430
Tell me first—

331
00:19:17,980 --> 00:19:19,850
who is this person

332
00:19:22,910 --> 00:19:24,310
who plays the qin so well?

333
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:39,910
Let's talk this out.

334
00:19:54,540 --> 00:19:56,070
Fair skin and tender flesh,

335
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:57,870
and no calluses on the hands.

336
00:19:58,410 --> 00:20:00,870
Looking at the rank
of the official uniform,

337
00:20:01,590 --> 00:20:03,250
they all listen to you, right?

338
00:20:05,150 --> 00:20:06,540
I can help you get away.

339
00:20:07,410 --> 00:20:08,350
But I

340
00:20:09,040 --> 00:20:10,500
also have a favor to ask.

341
00:20:10,960 --> 00:20:12,290
Put his hand down first.

342
00:20:12,430 --> 00:20:13,280
Whatever it is,

343
00:20:13,280 --> 00:20:14,740
-Yu Qian.
-you can tell me—

344
00:20:21,950 --> 00:20:25,670
Do you know how many refugees there are

345
00:20:27,150 --> 00:20:28,660
in the dense forest below?

346
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:33,880
The government turns a blind eye.

347
00:20:34,350 --> 00:20:36,680
Tons of people starve to death every year.

348
00:20:37,590 --> 00:20:39,040
If it weren't for our White Dragon Gang

349
00:20:39,040 --> 00:20:41,040
stealing some grain to distribute,

350
00:20:41,450 --> 00:20:42,780
this outside of the city

351
00:20:43,330 --> 00:20:45,530
would have become a mass grave long ago.

352
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:49,580
Jinling is the capital of virtue.

353
00:20:49,930 --> 00:20:50,870
How could things like this be happening?

354
00:20:50,870 --> 00:20:53,270
What's worse are those corrupt officials.

355
00:20:53,430 --> 00:20:56,230
We steal no more than
dozens of shi of grain a month.

356
00:20:56,290 --> 00:20:57,800
For every shi of grain we steal,

357
00:20:57,800 --> 00:20:59,330
they embezzle a tenth of it.

358
00:20:59,650 --> 00:21:00,780
At the end of the day,

359
00:21:01,410 --> 00:21:04,340
we still have to send 5 members
to the yamen every year

360
00:21:04,500 --> 00:21:06,150
to take the blame for them.

361
00:21:06,670 --> 00:21:07,830
They go in alive...

362
00:21:09,110 --> 00:21:10,190
and come out dead.

363
00:21:12,150 --> 00:21:14,410
To cover up their crime of embezzlement,

364
00:21:15,020 --> 00:21:16,890
how dare they treat human life like dirt?

365
00:21:16,890 --> 00:21:18,420
Treat human life like dirt?

366
00:21:19,770 --> 00:21:22,430
You just brush it off with one sentence.

367
00:21:23,170 --> 00:21:25,230
I'm not crying out to you for justice.

368
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:26,170
If you don't promise

369
00:21:26,170 --> 00:21:28,870
to uphold justice for us in the future,

370
00:21:29,690 --> 00:21:30,540
today

371
00:21:31,830 --> 00:21:33,140
ends here.

372
00:21:39,610 --> 00:21:40,590
Dragon Head.

373
00:21:41,350 --> 00:21:42,390
Let me ask you.

374
00:21:44,240 --> 00:21:45,370
Did you steal grain?

375
00:21:46,560 --> 00:21:48,090
Stealing makes you a thief.

376
00:21:49,060 --> 00:21:50,190
Did you rob?

377
00:21:50,720 --> 00:21:52,250
Robbing makes you a bandit.

378
00:21:53,060 --> 00:21:54,660
The imperial court has laws.

379
00:21:56,240 --> 00:21:57,330
If today

380
00:21:57,700 --> 00:21:58,700
you rob,

381
00:21:59,020 --> 00:21:59,820
then tomorrow

382
00:21:59,960 --> 00:22:01,150
others can rob too.

383
00:22:01,410 --> 00:22:03,010
The people will live in fear.

384
00:22:03,170 --> 00:22:04,230
Then let me ask you:

385
00:22:05,670 --> 00:22:07,600
what should the imperial court do?

386
00:22:07,760 --> 00:22:10,220
Who will the imperial court
negotiate with?

387
00:22:11,150 --> 00:22:12,910
And who will it reason with?

388
00:22:17,700 --> 00:22:18,950
I originally thought

389
00:22:20,260 --> 00:22:21,670
no matter how high and mighty someone is,

390
00:22:21,670 --> 00:22:23,130
when they come outside this city,

391
00:22:23,130 --> 00:22:25,930
they would take a look down
at the people in the mud.

392
00:22:26,060 --> 00:22:26,920
I didn't expect

393
00:22:28,800 --> 00:22:31,130
you wouldn't even give us a straight look.

394
00:22:35,390 --> 00:22:36,150
Dragon Head.

395
00:22:43,540 --> 00:22:44,600
The imperial court

396
00:22:45,930 --> 00:22:48,330
never listens to only
one side of the story.

397
00:22:49,980 --> 00:22:51,020
If you trust me,

398
00:22:53,430 --> 00:22:54,430
one day,

399
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:57,740
if I make it out in one piece,

400
00:23:04,590 --> 00:23:06,920
I will definitely get you an explanation.

401
00:23:15,220 --> 00:23:15,820
All right.

402
00:23:16,800 --> 00:23:18,910
Today, for the sake of Miss Hong,

403
00:23:20,300 --> 00:23:21,150
I

404
00:23:22,960 --> 00:23:24,360
will trust you this once.

405
00:23:46,040 --> 00:23:47,700
Hand him over to me.

406
00:24:02,800 --> 00:24:03,590
Sick Madman.

407
00:24:03,910 --> 00:24:04,870
Liang Xingfu.

408
00:24:08,540 --> 00:24:09,540
What do you want?

409
00:24:10,330 --> 00:24:11,950
Hand the Crown Prince

410
00:24:13,500 --> 00:24:15,150
over to me.

411
00:24:21,110 --> 00:24:21,970
Leave quickly.

412
00:24:22,650 --> 00:24:24,060
Your Highness, leave quickly.

413
00:24:24,060 --> 00:24:24,740
Long Si!

414
00:24:24,760 --> 00:24:26,490
Leave quickly, Your Highness.

415
00:24:32,020 --> 00:24:32,630
Hurry!

416
00:24:33,000 --> 00:24:33,500
Hurry!

417
00:24:35,630 --> 00:24:36,110
Hurry!

418
00:24:59,200 --> 00:25:01,150
I have already collected

419
00:25:01,800 --> 00:25:03,430
Iron Lion's body for him.

420
00:25:04,590 --> 00:25:05,630
Now,

421
00:25:06,330 --> 00:25:08,390
it's time to send you on your way.

422
00:25:41,700 --> 00:25:43,300
It took some effort

423
00:25:43,800 --> 00:25:44,910
for me to track you

424
00:25:45,590 --> 00:25:46,870
here.

425
00:25:48,520 --> 00:25:51,850
Your sister Wu Yulu
is under the protection of our alliance.

426
00:25:51,910 --> 00:25:53,540
Don't meddle in our affairs.

427
00:25:53,780 --> 00:25:55,780
I only want to kill the Crown Prince.

428
00:25:55,780 --> 00:25:57,910
You ungrateful bastard!

429
00:26:30,000 --> 00:26:31,740
They say Iron Lion's son

430
00:26:31,830 --> 00:26:33,160
is a good-for-nothing,

431
00:26:33,430 --> 00:26:35,630
but I don't think that's entirely true.

432
00:26:35,810 --> 00:26:38,290
Let me see what else
your father taught you.

433
00:26:46,760 --> 00:26:49,020
Even if you practice for a few more years,

434
00:26:49,560 --> 00:26:51,490
you still won't be able to fight me.

435
00:27:16,500 --> 00:27:18,430
Crown Prince, go!

436
00:27:19,020 --> 00:27:20,300
Hurry!

437
00:27:20,450 --> 00:27:22,220
Go!

438
00:27:29,740 --> 00:27:33,350
Remember what you said.

439
00:28:48,220 --> 00:28:48,950
Kill!

440
00:30:00,150 --> 00:30:00,980
Doctor Su!

441
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:02,860
Your Highness!

442
00:30:03,220 --> 00:30:04,350
Good-for-Nothing!

443
00:30:05,850 --> 00:30:06,710
Your Highness!

444
00:30:09,760 --> 00:30:10,890
Good-for-Nothing!

445
00:30:20,520 --> 00:30:21,650
Good-for-Nothing.

446
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,110
Where is Doctor Su?

447
00:30:23,590 --> 00:30:24,630
I didn't see her.

448
00:30:25,260 --> 00:30:26,120
Your Highness.

449
00:30:26,350 --> 00:30:27,210
Your Highness.

450
00:30:30,960 --> 00:30:31,590
Slow down.

451
00:30:32,020 --> 00:30:32,500
Okay.

452
00:30:35,090 --> 00:30:35,700
How is it?

453
00:30:37,460 --> 00:30:38,110
This way.

454
00:30:52,890 --> 00:30:54,190
Good-for-Nothing!

455
00:30:54,910 --> 00:30:55,950
Wu Dingyuan!

456
00:31:01,480 --> 00:31:02,700
Lord Yu!

457
00:31:49,370 --> 00:31:49,930
Hurry up!

458
00:32:02,690 --> 00:32:03,550
Your Highness.

459
00:32:05,740 --> 00:32:06,220
Hurry.

460
00:32:06,290 --> 00:32:07,890
Your Highness, you go first.

461
00:32:09,440 --> 00:32:10,330
Come, help me.

462
00:33:40,870 --> 00:33:41,540
Old Mule!

463
00:33:41,760 --> 00:33:42,760
He's catching up!

464
00:33:43,040 --> 00:33:43,740
Row faster!

465
00:33:46,380 --> 00:33:47,910
Your Highness, stand firm.

466
00:33:51,780 --> 00:33:53,180
Crown Prince, sit tight.

467
00:34:04,630 --> 00:34:06,230
Little Xingren, row faster!

468
00:34:13,020 --> 00:34:14,420
Don't look. Keep rowing.

469
00:34:20,400 --> 00:34:21,460
Stop looking. Row!

470
00:34:23,429 --> 00:34:24,310
Come on, hurry!

471
00:34:41,179 --> 00:34:42,500
Where are we going now?

472
00:34:42,770 --> 00:34:44,500
The Imperial Archives are ahead.

473
00:34:43,260 --> 00:34:47,070
[Imperial Archives]

474
00:34:44,850 --> 00:34:46,310
The islets on the back lake

475
00:34:46,460 --> 00:34:48,719
have been sealed off since the Hongwu era

476
00:34:48,870 --> 00:34:50,889
to store the national household registers.

477
00:34:50,889 --> 00:34:51,710
At night,

478
00:34:52,100 --> 00:34:54,960
the archive workers
usually rest on Longyin Islet.

479
00:34:55,270 --> 00:34:57,139
There should be no one here now.

480
00:34:57,460 --> 00:34:58,950
We can hide inside.

481
00:34:59,290 --> 00:35:00,420
We're almost there.

482
00:35:08,060 --> 00:35:08,540
Hurry!

483
00:35:09,120 --> 00:35:09,950
Go! Hurry up!

484
00:35:11,450 --> 00:35:11,980
Hurry up!

485
00:35:12,290 --> 00:35:12,830
This way.

486
00:35:13,730 --> 00:35:14,310
Hurry up!

487
00:35:16,410 --> 00:35:16,910
Here.

488
00:35:34,500 --> 00:35:35,030
This way.

489
00:36:14,400 --> 00:36:15,260
Your Highness.

490
00:36:15,830 --> 00:36:16,420
Careful!

491
00:36:16,890 --> 00:36:17,500
I'm fine.

492
00:36:21,860 --> 00:36:23,390
The Imperial Archives here

493
00:36:24,710 --> 00:36:26,100
record the population data

494
00:36:26,100 --> 00:36:28,140
of hundreds of
the 13 Provincial Administration Commissions'

495
00:36:28,140 --> 00:36:30,270
prefectures and counties—

496
00:36:32,140 --> 00:36:33,800
it's a huge number of records.

497
00:36:35,480 --> 00:36:37,340
On Liangzhou, the imperial court

498
00:36:37,830 --> 00:36:41,100
built more than a dozen such archives

499
00:36:41,790 --> 00:36:43,320
just to barely fit them all.

500
00:36:46,720 --> 00:36:48,380
Who exactly is Liang Xingfu?

501
00:36:49,910 --> 00:36:51,440
The White Dragon Gang chief

502
00:36:51,560 --> 00:36:54,090
looked as if he had seen a ghost
when he saw him.

503
00:36:54,980 --> 00:36:57,500
Wu Dingyuan called him
an ungrateful scoundrel

504
00:36:57,500 --> 00:36:59,230
and wanted to kill him right away.

505
00:36:59,230 --> 00:37:00,290
What kind of grudge

506
00:37:00,540 --> 00:37:02,000
do they have between them?

507
00:37:03,500 --> 00:37:04,230
I am not clear

508
00:37:05,350 --> 00:37:06,620
about these things.

509
00:37:08,020 --> 00:37:09,710
But I know he has a nickname:

510
00:37:10,750 --> 00:37:11,680
the Sick Madman.

511
00:37:14,930 --> 00:37:16,230
In the 18th year of the Yongle reign,

512
00:37:16,230 --> 00:37:19,140
this person once caused
a huge uproar in Jinling City.

513
00:37:19,140 --> 00:37:20,200
Single-handedly,

514
00:37:20,370 --> 00:37:22,240
he scattered the entire city gate guard.

515
00:37:22,240 --> 00:37:25,240
It took over a hundred experts
to force him to retreat.

516
00:37:25,710 --> 00:37:28,810
After that, he hid in the streets
and alleys of the south of the city,

517
00:37:28,810 --> 00:37:29,770
committing crimes every night,

518
00:37:29,770 --> 00:37:31,540
causing a sensation in the whole city.

519
00:37:31,540 --> 00:37:34,000
The government
even sent out all its elites.

520
00:37:34,710 --> 00:37:35,970
Wu Buping and Iron Lion

521
00:37:36,180 --> 00:37:39,310
should have also participated
in the pursuit back then.

522
00:37:39,890 --> 00:37:41,490
This person appeared madly,

523
00:37:41,500 --> 00:37:42,900
disappeared bizarrely,

524
00:37:43,270 --> 00:37:45,160
and attacked without any rules,

525
00:37:45,160 --> 00:37:46,490
regardless of his life.

526
00:37:47,620 --> 00:37:49,460
People call him the Sick Madman.

527
00:38:08,290 --> 00:38:09,090
Liang Xingfu.

528
00:38:09,160 --> 00:38:10,790
Can we not mention

529
00:38:10,810 --> 00:38:13,210
those terrible things in the past anymore?

530
00:38:19,350 --> 00:38:20,620
Liang Xingfu.

531
00:38:20,980 --> 00:38:23,710
My father took such a big risk
to save you back then

532
00:38:24,000 --> 00:38:25,310
and even took you in.

533
00:38:25,540 --> 00:38:28,000
If he had known you would be
so ungrateful today,

534
00:38:28,000 --> 00:38:29,410
and if he were still alive,

535
00:38:29,410 --> 00:38:31,140
he would regret it deeply!

536
00:38:31,480 --> 00:38:32,830
If he knew

537
00:38:33,020 --> 00:38:34,280
that you father and son

538
00:38:34,350 --> 00:38:35,790
could meet again in the underworld

539
00:38:35,790 --> 00:38:37,310
in less than a day,

540
00:38:37,830 --> 00:38:38,790
his face

541
00:38:39,250 --> 00:38:40,890
would be blooming with joy.

542
00:38:44,310 --> 00:38:45,170
Your Highness.

543
00:38:47,620 --> 00:38:48,480
Your Highness!

544
00:38:50,330 --> 00:38:51,190
Your Highness.

545
00:38:53,120 --> 00:38:53,980
Your Highness!

546
00:38:54,290 --> 00:38:55,150
Your Highness.

547
00:38:55,540 --> 00:38:56,400
Your Highness!

548
00:38:57,140 --> 00:38:58,200
I found a back door.

549
00:38:58,310 --> 00:38:59,440
But we have to go around

550
00:38:59,440 --> 00:39:00,570
to leave this place.

551
00:39:03,410 --> 00:39:04,270
Your Highness?

552
00:39:05,020 --> 00:39:05,880
Your Highness!

553
00:39:08,320 --> 00:39:09,980
We're leaving just like this?

554
00:39:12,140 --> 00:39:14,140
What about that good-for-nothing?

555
00:39:35,270 --> 00:39:36,790
The blood flowing in you

556
00:39:37,660 --> 00:39:39,270
is also your father's blood.

557
00:39:40,020 --> 00:39:40,460
Let go!

558
00:39:40,560 --> 00:39:41,960
-Let go!
-Your Highness!

559
00:39:42,230 --> 00:39:43,480
Since things have come to this,

560
00:39:43,480 --> 00:39:45,680
Wu Dingyuan will definitely die today.

561
00:39:45,910 --> 00:39:47,620
We can't let petty kindness

562
00:39:48,070 --> 00:39:49,990
-lead to a big mistake!
-My hand!

563
00:39:50,540 --> 00:39:51,620
My hand!

564
00:39:56,290 --> 00:39:57,090
Rectifier Yu.

565
00:39:57,730 --> 00:39:58,390
Let go of me.

566
00:39:59,500 --> 00:40:00,300
I won't let go.

567
00:40:00,310 --> 00:40:00,790
Let go!

568
00:40:00,890 --> 00:40:01,690
I won't let go.

569
00:40:02,100 --> 00:40:03,140
You bastard.

570
00:40:03,770 --> 00:40:04,570
I won't let go!

571
00:40:06,140 --> 00:40:07,870
I just won't let go today!

572
00:40:08,710 --> 00:40:10,060
There's something

573
00:40:10,330 --> 00:40:11,580
between you and me—

574
00:40:12,680 --> 00:40:15,230
just like the character "Yuan"
in your name,

575
00:40:16,230 --> 00:40:17,790
it's fate.

576
00:40:19,140 --> 00:40:21,960
I've known your father for a long time.

577
00:40:22,020 --> 00:40:24,460
I wanted to let you go,

578
00:40:24,750 --> 00:40:28,010
but you kept hindering
the great cause of my Iron Alliance.

579
00:40:29,060 --> 00:40:30,980
I'm going to kill you now.

580
00:40:31,600 --> 00:40:32,910
Do you have

581
00:40:34,040 --> 00:40:35,240
anything else to say?

582
00:40:39,140 --> 00:40:40,500
Just kill me!

583
00:40:41,000 --> 00:40:42,060
I won't let go!

584
00:40:42,230 --> 00:40:42,950
I won't!

585
00:40:44,210 --> 00:40:45,140
Let me go!

586
00:40:53,640 --> 00:40:54,640
Your Highness...

587
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:55,580
Your...

588
00:41:07,890 --> 00:41:08,750
Rectifier Yu.

589
00:41:10,960 --> 00:41:12,100
Let me ask you,

590
00:41:13,020 --> 00:41:14,620
can you protect me all the way

591
00:41:15,790 --> 00:41:16,830
to Beijing?

592
00:41:23,870 --> 00:41:24,910
I cannot.

593
00:41:25,850 --> 00:41:27,960
But neither can Wu Dingyuan.

594
00:41:30,950 --> 00:41:31,660
Yes.

595
00:41:33,560 --> 00:41:35,360
Wu Dingyuan might not be able to,

596
00:41:38,000 --> 00:41:39,950
but if we work together,

597
00:41:42,480 --> 00:41:43,580
maybe we can.

598
00:41:46,080 --> 00:41:47,140
Can we really?

599
00:41:48,370 --> 00:41:49,020
We can.

600
00:41:50,730 --> 00:41:51,790
We definitely can.

601
00:41:52,980 --> 00:41:54,270
If we work together,

602
00:41:55,310 --> 00:41:56,460
we definitely can.

603
00:42:04,540 --> 00:42:05,400
Your Highness.

604
00:42:07,200 --> 00:42:07,590
Let's go.

605
00:42:07,590 --> 00:42:08,300
Don't cry.

606
00:42:09,810 --> 00:42:10,460
I'm here.

607
00:42:10,480 --> 00:42:11,270
Help me up.

608
00:42:11,950 --> 00:42:13,950
-Yes, Your Highness.
-Help me walk.

609
00:42:15,390 --> 00:42:16,390
Pick up the torch.

610
00:42:19,430 --> 00:42:19,950
Go!

611
00:42:22,560 --> 00:42:23,290
Sick Madman.

612
00:42:25,520 --> 00:42:28,330
When I finally settle this score,

613
00:42:29,060 --> 00:42:30,460
leaving nothing behind,

614
00:42:32,140 --> 00:42:34,270
that's when I can sleep peacefully,

615
00:42:35,540 --> 00:42:36,830
and we'll be even.
